Package: checkboxr
Title: Clean and Summarize Select-All-That-Apply Survey Questions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jake", "Harmon", email = "jakebharmon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Declares which columns belong to one checkbox
    (select-all-that-apply) survey question, recodes the question to NA for
    respondents who gave no usable answer (don't know, prefer not to answer,
    skipped), and summarizes each question in a 'gtsummary' table with one
    row per option and the correct denominator.
